  <item>
    <title>EP26 如果一个妈妈是勇敢且自由的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671d05b444ae79002c3e7382</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671d05b444ae79002c3e7382</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 28 Oct 2024 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>小嘉×肆月</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>我们总是希望妈妈不被困于厨房</span></p><span></span><p><span>她应该有自己的世界</span></p><span></span><p><span>而成为这样一位妈妈的小孩</span></p><span></span><p><span>又会作何感想呢🌙</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>今天结尾的歌曲是Charlie Puth的I Dont Think That I Like Her</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>听到这首歌</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>就像看到两个人在海边斜阳下的气氛升温</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>多年以后再想起那一天的傍晚</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>是独一无二的日月交辉</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>原来他们陪伴在彼此身边</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>已经这么久了</span></strong></em><span>🌙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="88">01:28</a>潇洒的另外一面是自私吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="288">04:48</a>我们只是希望自己的小孩能好好享福</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="429">07:09</a>大张伟名言</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="555">09:15</a>女孩子真的需要很好的经济支撑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="702">11:42</a>家里的第一个孩子可能都听过这句“怕你太孤单”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="856">14:16</a>母亲陪伴的缺失会有很大影响吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="893">14:53</a>她首先是她自己，其次才是妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1084">18:04</a>一些小时候的幼稚想法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1108">18:28</a>质疑婉瑜，理解婉瑜，成为婉瑜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a>相亲遇见的下头行为</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1476">24:36</a>可以恋爱脑，但是对方要值得</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1584">26:24</a>爱的过程很重要，不要内耗自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1676">27:56</a>祖祖辈辈流传下来的传统，肯定也有好的一面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1797">29:57</a>总结一下！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1848">30:48</a>过一段时间再见啦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1868">31:08</a>对你说晚安啦，下个春天见！快来听歌啦🌙</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltLy5Pi5-nTO27ZitnHSNAsHtJs_.m4a" length="49896033" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:34:24</itunes:duration>
