    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP25 站在十字路口，该选什么呢</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671529c9db2cf82757a034f4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671529c9db2cf82757a034f4</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 21 Oct 2024 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>小嘉×肆月</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>在繁华的城市里</span></p><span></span><p><span>也曾不断地问自己</span></p><span></span><p><span>这就是小时候期待的长大吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>但是我爱上的</span></p><span></span><p><span>到底是想象中的繁华都市</span></p><span></span><p><span>还是印象里骑着电动车就能转完的小城镇</span></p><span></span><p><span>而问题的答案</span></p><span></span><p><span>谁说的清楚</span></p><span></span><p><span>谁又想把他说清楚呢🌙</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>今天结尾的歌曲是Justin Bieber的Love Yourself</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>由ed sheeran主作词，作曲，原版和声，justin演唱的love yourself</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>听来有些许触动</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>或许这才是最美好的和平分手的结局</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>看似轻快实则离别伤感的吉他奏音</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>让原本伤痛的故事变得听似释然与轻松</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>内心深藏的心结在这悠然绵长的演唱中尽情宣露</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>“弦弦掩抑声声思”</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>吉他的独奏配合justin的浅吟低唱</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>缓缓诉说着告别</span></strong></em><span>🌙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="46">00:46</a>别管了，真的很羡慕会背书的人！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="238">03:58</a>在传媒人心中，中传一定是白月光啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="365">06:05</a>以后的职业选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="604">10:04</a>就业环境不好，关于就业可以问问身边的人脉！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="932">15:32</a>找到一个不讨厌的专业和工作已经很不容易了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1211">20:11</a>选大城市还是选小城市呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1645">27:25</a>总结一下叭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1698">28:18</a>晚安咯，听歌啦🌙</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llhVNt3OU2KkC0HurvnUcLItxIT3.m4a" length="46894955" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:32:19</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtX_Od0uVdrgi13ngC1T_DRvkRYo.png"/>
