  <item>
    <title>EP23 大学期间的成长也很值得铭记</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6702a8126c7f8177861f3f78</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6702a8126c7f8177861f3f78</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 07 Oct 2024 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>脸脸×肆月</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>你还记得</span></p><span></span><p><span>你的大学生活是怎样的吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>它可能充斥着大学城小吃街的暖黄色灯光</span></p><span></span><p><span>也有操场月光下的十指生根</span></p><span></span><p><span>但是更多的</span></p><span></span><p><span>是在不知不觉中</span></p><span></span><p><span>就成了一个有点世俗的大人🌙</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>今天结尾的歌曲是Oscar Isaac&amp;Marcus Mumford的Fare Thee Well</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>这首歌是电影《醉乡民谣》当中的一首插曲</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>人花了一生都在追逐梦想</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>所以你不允许别人侮辱你的梦想</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>当你最后觉得自己的梦都很可笑时</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>你便想放弃自己所追求了一身的东西</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>却发现已经无法回头</span></strong></em><span>🌙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a>融媒体方向的广播电视专业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="358">05:58</a>全能型人才真的很稀缺！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="457">07:37</a>个人的未来方向如何选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 一段快乐的实习经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a>大学生活给我们带来的一些成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 希望我们都不要成为世俗的大人啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1961">32:41</a>考研，不要放弃每一个迅速提升认知的机会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2130">35:30</a>想做好新传和艺术的话，先好好生活吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2213">36:53</a>晚安啦，快来听歌咯🌙</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmE9y4dZv_Pr-QGoRiFVxnE8ISWC.m4a" length="57535075" type="audio/mp4"/>
