  <item>
    <title>EP22 年轻人的养生小tip！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66fa35b681cdab3a9314dee9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66fa35b681cdab3a9314dee9</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 30 Sep 2024 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>张张×肆月</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>请接收来自节目结尾的一大波祝福！！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>每一个生命都是礼物</span></p><span></span><p><span>请不要妄自菲薄</span></p><span></span><p><span>抓住这个秋天的尾巴</span></p><span></span><p><span>然后继续去寻自己的月亮</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝福大家长命百岁🌙</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>今天结尾的歌曲是The Chainsmokers&amp;Halsey的Closer</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>公告牌曾这样评价这首歌：“《Closer》有着完美的二重唱和极具辨识度的hook，它以极具感染力的方式捕捉了千禧一代的时代精神。”</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>《Closer》的创作灵感受到乐队Blink-182的启发</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>这首欢快的合成器电子舞曲在2016年的夏天被无限循环</span></strong></em><span>🌙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="117">01:57</a>女孩子冬天手脚冰凉不是常态吗呜呜呜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="297">04:57</a>大学还是要抓住机会出去看一看</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="704">11:44</a>人生会有很多条路，别困住自己，尽力去做就好了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="958">15:58</a>中医的神奇之处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1489">24:49</a>请收下这些美好祝愿！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1697">28:17</a>预告下期！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1705">28:25</a>晚安呀，来听歌咯🌙</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqHb3iLxMuZ7QwocUxTcPIhW9YRE.m4a" length="47097063" type="audio/mp4"/>
