  <item>
    <title>EP20 或许勇敢一次就能看到更大的世界了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e7e8925ca6d0ace348498c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e7e8925ca6d0ace348498c</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 16 Sep 2024 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>Yuki×肆月</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>面对一件从来没做过的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span>害怕是很正常的</span></p><span></span><p><span>但我们小的时候都读过《城南旧事》</span></p><span></span><p><span>有一句话支撑着我走了很多年</span></p><span></span><p><span>“什么事，硬着头皮去做，总能做完的”</span></p><span></span><p><span>后来我凭着这句话</span></p><span></span><p><span>见过了更大的世界🌙</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>今天结尾的歌曲是Lauv的Paris In The Rain</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>每每提到巴黎</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>都会想起春日阳光中如幻想般美好的香榭丽舍</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>流星夜空下恋人双双的埃菲尔铁塔</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>万宝汇聚、辉煌气派的卢浮宫</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>可是，你有没有见识过巴黎的雨夜呢</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>雨点如线，仿若恋人间的纵横牵绊</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>朦胧雾气将二人笼罩</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>像是大自然送上的纱绸，清幽而淡雅</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>是最适合告白的时候</span></strong></em><strong><span>🌙</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="69">01:09</a>祝大家都有甜甜的恋爱！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="361">06:01</a>无论处在什么样的关系当中都要保持自己的独立性啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="757">12:37</a>转变一下！收到礼物是被在意的表现呀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="936">15:36</a>独自西藏之行——勇敢一次就会见到更大的世界了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1582">26:22</a>那些慢慢来的moment，是生活赐予的最大奖励</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2170">36:10</a>预告下期啦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2245">37:25</a>晚安咯！来听歌啦🌙</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loWIRJJP0fQfIfQkMh1HqdOwbdKS.m4a" length="57652968" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:39:44</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FufCIqfBGEDIaUMH1PJXjSKlYU9P.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP19 谈天说地讲心事！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66de8e48ee04007d88305974</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66de8e48ee04007d88305974</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Sep 2024 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>Yuki×肆月</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>忙起来的时候</span></p><span></span><p><span>好像连和朋友说废话的时间都没有了</span></p><span></span><p><span>但其实</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间的本质就在于被浪费</span></p><span></span><p><span>那些天马行空、毫无关系的话语</span></p><span></span><p><span>只有好朋友才能get到🌙</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>今天结尾的歌曲是Troye Sivan的YOUTH</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>这是一首讲述充满童趣天真的童年和迷失自己的歌曲</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>也是关于抛弃一切、逃避、犯错以及深沉的爱</span></strong></em><span>🌙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">02:25</a>毕业后的GAP！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="499">08:19</a>某招聘软件趣事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="700">11:40</a>谨慎考研二战！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1002">16:42</a>外地上大学的n多好处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1520">25:20</a>MBTI之两只蝴蝶的碰撞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1706">28:26</a>《毛血汪》之i人天堂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1963">32:43</a>不排斥相亲是怎样的想法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2645">44:05</a>遇见不合适的伴侣一定一定要及时止损啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2773">46:13</a>很多自认为在感情当中做不到的事其实是不够喜欢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3081">51:21</a>对你说晚安啦，快来听歌呀🌙</span></p>]]></description>
