    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>小周×肆月</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>找工作的朋友们看过来！</span></p><span></span><p><span>收下这期节目中的面试指南！</span></p><span></span><p><span>工作之后还会有好朋友吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>这个问题好像在不同的时期困住了不同的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>所幸在每一个人生阶段都有那些特别的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>他们说</span></p><span></span><p><span>世界上总会幸存着柔光🌙</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>今天结尾的歌曲是Sam Lin的Turn The Page</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>大家的终点都不一样</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>但还是愿意在某一刻</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>和自己走一段</span></strong></em><span>🌙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="53">00:53</a>工作之后还会交到好朋友吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="218">03:38</a>一些酒桌文化还会被延续下去吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="351">05:51</a>工作后的恋爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="956">15:56</a>新媒体可以来杭州发展哦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">17:25</a>创业伙伴一定要选好！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1279">21:19</a>面试技巧看这里！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1390">23:10</a>工作以后可能真的不能精致了哈哈哈哈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1422">23:42</a>只要能满足一个目标就好了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1611">26:51</a>找到真正喜欢的事情是很难的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1816">30:16</a>推荐宝藏博主：李诞、杨天真！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2031">33:51</a>下期预告！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2055">34:15</a>晚安呀！来听歌咯🌙</span></p>]]></description>
