    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>小周×肆月</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>曾经把床单披在身上</span></p><span></span><p><span>说自己是拯救全世界的超人</span></p><span></span><p><span>长大以后才发现</span></p><span></span><p><span>原来每个人都处在不同的水深火热当中</span></p><span></span><p><span>当曾经向往的已经被牢牢攥住</span></p><span></span><p><span>那份憧憬是否也随风而去了呢🌙</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>今天结尾的歌曲是Anson Seabra的Magazines</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>她来自比道路更遥远的地方</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>她触摸草原</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>花朵的赭石色</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>凭这只用烟书写的手</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>她通过寂静战胜时间</span></strong></em><span>🌙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a>从央企到大厂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="433">07:13</a>毕业工作地区的选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a>可能上班之后就想创业了吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1215">20:15</a>一位室友的快速个人就业想法转变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1301">21:41</a>西部计划也是很好的选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1483">24:43</a>遇到单休工作的时候，选择会变得踌躇吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1655">27:35</a>对你说晚安啦！听歌听歌🌙</span></p>]]></description>
