  <item>
    <title>EP16 那就坦然的去面对爱吧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b4e7d2db5e6d6bf9ee7be2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b4e7d2db5e6d6bf9ee7be2</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 19 Aug 2024 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>伟伟×肆月</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>我们这一生会面对很多很多的爱</span></p><span></span><p><span>亲情、友情、爱情</span></p><span></span><p><span>当然还有来自陌生人的爱意</span></p><span></span><p><span>他们不分先后</span></p><span></span><p><span>是我们短暂一生中最宝贵的礼物🌙</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>今天结尾的歌曲是Green Day的Good Riddance</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>那些宝贵的东西永远值得珍惜</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>有些事难以预料</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>但最后总会好的</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>我愿你能享受生命的好时光</span></strong></em><span>🌙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="67">01:07</a>亲情和友情总会让人感动落泪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="286">04:46</a>一些视频当中的恶意对待只是小概率事件！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="683">11:23</a>也会有另外一种观点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="711">11:51</a>初出茅庐，自由职业还是会有很大的吸引力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="937">15:37</a>兼职摄影师是个不错的选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1145">19:05</a>婚礼主持也是一条出路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1280">21:20</a>播客被夸夸啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1417">23:37</a>很多东西，得到过就好啦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1763">29:23</a>下期预告！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1785">29:45</a>晚安啦！来听歌啦🌙</span></p>]]></description>
