  <item>
    <title>EP15 冷门的“养老”专业带来了很多感动</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66afab557349f7a557b5159e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66afab557349f7a557b5159e</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 Aug 2024 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>伟伟×肆月</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>也许你没听说过这个专业</span></p><span></span><p><span>它需要很多很多的爱作为支撑</span></p><span></span><p><span>那些令人感动的心灵触碰</span></p><span></span><p><span>他们是离这场洗礼最近的人🌙</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>今天结尾的歌曲是Mree的Goodnight＆Goodbye</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>旋律清新恬静</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>Mree的嗓音轻柔婉转</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>想起电影《楚门的世界》中的台词</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>“Good morning, and in case I don’t see ya, good afternoon, good evening and good night.”&nbsp;</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>或许比起“Goodbye”</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>“Good night”会少一些分别的感伤</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>多一分明日能再与你相遇的期待吧</span></strong></em><span>🌙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="79">01:19</a>神奇“养老”专业的简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="256">04:16</a>实习当中也会有些小插曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">08:20</a>爱会让人长出新的血肉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="808">13:28</a>老人有很多大智慧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="921">15:21</a> &nbsp;一位好的老师真的会带来很多触动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1215">20:15</a>关于星座和MBTI的探讨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1427">23:47</a>很想要的东西得不到的时候也会让我们有更多的时间学习和思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1755">29:15</a>好的恋人会支持你的所有进步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2361">39:21</a>晚安啦！快来听歌咯 🌙</span></p>]]></description>
