    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>小雪×肆月</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>你不需要改变任何地方</span></p><span></span><p><span>你不必那么卖力尝试</span></p><span></span><p><span>你不必委曲求全</span></p><span></span><p><span>你只需要勇敢的面对你自己🌙</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>今天结尾的歌曲是Colbie Caillat的Try</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>女孩们不必为了迎合别人的眼光而试图改变真我</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>保持最原始纯粹的自己才是最美丽的状态</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>这首歌曲的MV同样令人印象深刻</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>一群各不相同的女性在镜头前擦卸妆容，脱下假发</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>最后她们展露出了发自内心的微笑</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>学会去珍爱那个毫无修饰的自己</span></strong></em><span>🌙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:48</a>放松的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a>有好朋友陪着真的很重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="407">06:47</a>关于MBTI的讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="738">12:18</a>大城市的“冷漠”带来的不关注也有可能会成为我们的保护壳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a>十几岁很美好但是不想再回去了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1306">21:46</a>一些喜欢的小说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1542">25:42</a>我们很快就会有不同的新认知</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1898">31:38</a>我们可能会觉得自己普通，但普通他不是一个贬义词</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2030">33:50</a>预告下期啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a>对你说晚安啦！听歌咯🌙</span></p>]]></description>
