    <title>EP13 且视他人疑目如盏盏鬼火，大胆去走自己的夜路</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a66a477349f7a55722cdcd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a66a477349f7a55722cdcd</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 29 Jul 2024 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>小雪×肆月</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>好像一直以来已经习惯</span></p><span></span><p><span>用别人的目光来做自己的镜子</span></p><span></span><p><span>但史铁生说：</span></p><span></span><p><span>“且视他人疑目如盏盏鬼火，大胆去走自己的夜路。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>要知道</span></p><span></span><p><span>月亮可从来不听星星的话🌙</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>今天结尾的歌曲是Tep No的Me and My Guitar</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>也许都歇斯底里</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>因为爱的逐渐消逝</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>唯一能做的就是捡起来碎掉的真心去遇见下一个对的人</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>我永远保持爱与真诚</span></strong></em><span>🌙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a>大概人生的每个阶段想要的东西都不一样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="207">03:27</a>人生的容错率超乎想象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="388">06:28</a>如果一定要有目标，那就定一个能看得到的吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="422">07:02</a>如果原生家庭偶尔有点窒息，那就努力让自己跳出来吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="852">14:12</a>来自一位00后初中生的焦虑和困惑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1118">18:38</a>“唯结果论”会让我们丧失很多机会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1292">21:32</a>女性意识不是排斥男性而是欣赏自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a>夸奖的话就收下， 不好的言语有则改之无则加勉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1988">33:08</a>一定要合群吗？在星星当中成为月亮也还不错</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2230">37:10</a>晚安咯！快来听歌呀🌙</span></p>]]></description>
